<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Confirmez votre email — MusLinks</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif; background: #f0fdf4; margin: 0; padding: 20px; }
        .container { max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; background: white; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }
        .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #064E3B 0%, #059669 100%); padding: 40px 40px 32px; text-align: center; }
        .logo { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; text-decoration: none; }
        .logo-text { color: white; font-size: 22px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: -0.5px; }
        .body { padding: 40px; }
        .title { font-size: 22px; font-weight: bold; color: #064E3B; margin: 0 0 12px; }
        .text { color: #475569; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0 0 24px; }
        .btn { display: block; background: #059669; color: white; text-decoration: none; text-align: center; padding: 16px 32px; border-radius: 12px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; margin: 28px 0; }
        .btn:hover { background: #047857; }
        .link-fallback { background: #f8fafc; border-radius: 10px; padding: 14px 18px; font-size: 12px; color: #64748b; word-break: break-all; }
        .footer { padding: 20px 40px; border-top: 1px solid #f1f5f9; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #94a3b8; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
    <div class="header">
        <div class="logo">
            <svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 200 200" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                <defs>
                    <radialGradient id="em-bg" cx="30%" cy="25%" r="75%">
                        <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#10b981"/>
                        <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#064e3b"/>
                    </radialGradient>
                    <mask id="em-crescent">
                        <rect width="200" height="200" fill="white"/>
                        <circle cx="126" cy="80" r="62" fill="black"/>
                    </mask>
                </defs>
                <circle cx="100" cy="100" r="96" fill="url(#em-bg)"/>
                <circle cx="100" cy="100" r="95" fill="none" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.25)" stroke-width="2.5"/>
                <circle cx="94" cy="108" r="64" fill="#FCD34D" mask="url(#em-crescent)"/>
                <text x="122" y="88" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central"
                      font-family="Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif"
                      font-size="28" font-weight="bold" font-style="italic"
                      fill="#FCD34D" letter-spacing="-1">ML</text>
            </svg>
            <span class="logo-text">MusLinks</span>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="body">
        <p class="title">Confirmez votre adresse email</p>

        <p class="text">
            Bonjour {{ professional.nomSociete }},<br><br>
            Merci de votre inscription sur MusLinks. Pour finaliser votre demande,
            veuillez confirmer votre adresse email en cliquant sur le bouton ci-dessous.
        </p>

        <a href="{{ link }}" class="btn">Confirmer mon email →</a>

        <p class="text" style="font-size:13px; color:#64748b;">
            Après confirmation, votre fiche sera <strong>publiée automatiquement</strong> dans l'annuaire.
        </p>

        <div class="link-fallback">
            <strong>Lien de secours :</strong><br>
            {{ link }}
        </div>

        <p class="text" style="font-size:12px; margin-top:20px; color:#94a3b8;">
            Si vous n'avez pas effectué cette inscription, ignorez cet email.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
        &copy; {{ "now"|date("Y") }} MusLinks — Votre réseau de confiance
    </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
